Comment: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.80,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:02.43,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.21,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思議了...
Comment: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:11.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.28,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人無法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:20.17,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狹窄的道路上  我們巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:23.19,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立馬就被你那黑洞一樣的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.24,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和誇張
Comment: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:27.26,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}爲何會讓我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.86,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能會下雨
Comment: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:36.12,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午飯吧
Comment: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:39.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在陽光下盡情享受著日光浴
Comment: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:42.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}這小可愛到底是何方神聖
Comment: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:46.40,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}從今往後  我都是屬於你的了
Comment: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.48,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}過度的深愛  讓時空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:53.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不覺間  你已經成爲了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:54.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:55.78,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}讓我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:58.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}説是命運也好  奇迹也罷
Comment: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:02.02,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我們的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:05.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中懸吊的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:09.03,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}純然的愛不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身邊...
